WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:00.574 --> 00:00:02.030
India is amazing.

00:00:02.030 --> 00:00:03.302
Different folk.

00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:06.000
Doing different things.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.190
Some taking us forward in medicine.

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.472
And some in computer science.

00:00:10.472 --> 00:00:13.671
Some in acting

00:00:13.671 --> 00:00:15.323
Some in automobiles.

00:00:16.937 --> 00:00:19.462
Some waving the flag at the Olympics.

00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:20.776
Some on the moon.

00:00:22.374 --> 00:00:23.989
Someone's a beauty queen.

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.275
And someone's a tech genius.

00:00:26.923 --> 00:00:30.077
This diversity is India's strength.

00:00:30.604 --> 00:00:33.000
And that of its mutual funds.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.000
So this Republic Day...

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.306
Take some money out of the savings jar at home.

00:00:37.306 --> 00:00:39.816
And invest it in India's growth.

00:00:39.816 --> 00:00:42.899
Invest it in mutual funds.

